# The Tide Engine - the quest "The Seventh Tide" played through (plan Relic of the Seventh Tide, the finale)
# The ring at 5 m, the well (the heart) at 2 m, r 13, its ramp from the south rim (0 -22..-10). Landing 0 -44, wheel
# hall 28.5 0 (sluice channel z -12 from x 36 east, at -3), crane hall 0 28.5 (the crane cab 0 38 at 11), piston
# hall -28.5 0, the ring's top -42 0 at 9.5. Kett's cage 8 -20 on the south rim. Beam: emitter -6.8 -6, mirrors -6 -2
# and 6 -2, the reactor panel 6 6.
# 10-25 deep pass: the island is r 110 now (landing path from 0 -106). After the ring's top, the epilogue: the tide vault
# (-62 -84, -10 m) tried without its key, the Watch Hill (-60 45, 26 m; trail foot -60 24) and Grey's mast (the key),
# Okafor's cave at 66 44, then the vault and Ostrander's letter.
island The Tide Engine
offset 0 0
expect title The Seventh Tide
walk 0 -54 to 0 -46 h=5
zone landing
read Kett's final camp log
kill Hyena
expect step 3
open Syndicate supply crate
expect story radiocodes 1
use radio
expect story taunt 1
expect step 6
walk 6 -38 to 20 -20 to 28.5 -6 to 28.5 0 h=5
zone wheel_hall
read Engine diagram
use sluicelever
expect message will not move
use wheel1
use wheel2
use wheel3
expect story wheelturn 3
expect spinsown wheel1
use sluicelever
expect hidden sluicegate
expect step 10
zone sluice_gallery
kill Stingray
open Sluice cache
expect item TitaniumIngot 2
expect step 13
walk 28.5 6 to 20 20 to 0 22 to 0 26 h=5
zone crane_hall
use claw
expect hidden armlow
expect shown armhigh
read The Seventh Tide tablet
use cabladder
expect height 11.2
zone arm_top
open Crane cab locker
expect story cagekey 1
zone heart_rim
open Kett's satchel
expect message cage key first
use kettcage
expect survivor seventhtide_kett
open Kett's satchel
read Kett's warning
expect step 20
walk 0 -22 to 0 -12 to 0 -6 h=2
zone heart
kill Polar bear
expect step 22
use seventhlever
expect message locked
beam emitter
use mirror1
wait 1
beam emitter
use mirror2
wait 2
beam emitter
expect story heartbeam 1
read Heart inscription
use seventhlever
expect hidden coreglow
expect shown coldlights
expect story enginestopped 1
expect step 25
open Engine treasury
expect story relic 1
walk -28.5 -6 to -28.5 0 to -36 0 to -42 0 h=9.5
zone ring_top
wait 3
expect step 28
open Tide vault
expect message tide vault key
zone watchfoot
expect step 29
zone watchtop
expect step 30
read Silas Grey's last log
expect step 31
open Grey's last lookout box
wait 3
expect story vaultkey 1
expect step 32
zone okafor_cave
read Nell Okafor's note
# (the key-less try already took the player into the zone, so the reach step counts with the key)
zone gaugehouse
expect step 34
open Tide vault
wait 2
expect step 35
read Dr. Ostrander's last letter
expect done
